<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In the occupied West Bank, at least six new settler outposts went up within days of Friday's killings near Tal, alongside home raids, demolitions and more than a hundred detentions.</s> <s>An outpost begins illegal even under Israel's own law... and then the state supplies it with a road, a water line, electricity and soldiers, after which it's legalised retroactively.</s> <s>Counting outposts is how you measure annexation happening without anyone declaring it.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In El-Obeid, in Sudan, a woman named Nafisah died reaching for an ambulance that had no fuel.</s> <s>Rapid Support Forces drone strikes have hit the city's power and fuel networks rather than its hospitals, so dialysis machines, oxygen concentrators and neonatal incubators fail without a single ward being struck — and the deaths are recorded as renal failure, not as strikes.</s> <s>El-Obeid is the junction between Khartoum and Darfur, the RSF is armed by the <sub alias="U A E">UAE</sub>, and no deadline exists for lifting the siege.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel and Lebanon will send technical teams to Rome from the fourth to the sixth of August, with thirteen disputed points along the Blue Line still unsettled.</s> <s>The word technical is doing the work here — the political framework was agreed, and the questions that couldn't be settled politically, including Hezbollah's weapons north of the Litani, were pushed down into working groups instead.</s> <s>That's not progress toward a settlement... it's a way of keeping a ceasefire alive without one, while Israeli strikes on south Lebanon continued through Monday.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Donald Trump publicly waved away Benjamin Netanyahu's objection to selling F-thirty-fives to Türkiye, saying nobody tells him what to sell.</s> <s>US law obliges Washington to preserve Israel's qualitative military edge in any regional arms sale, but Ankara's actual obstacle is different — it was expelled from the F-thirty-five programme in twenty nineteen over its Russian S-four-hundred batteries.</s> <s>No contract exists yet, and what Ankara does with those batteries will decide whether one ever does.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi Arabia says it shot down drones launched from Iraqi territory, and blamed militias backed by Iran.</s> <s>The arrangement is deliberate on every side: deniable by Tehran, unattributable to Baghdad, and far cheaper to launch than the interceptors that destroy them.</s> <s>Iraq's government hasn't confirmed the launches, which leaves the one party with sovereignty over the ground unable or unwilling to account for what left it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria, armed men stormed a voter-card centre in Osun state on Sunday, weeks before the fifteenth of August vote.</s> <s>The electoral commission's answer is hardware — six hundred and sixty-four backup biometric units among four thousand four hundred and twenty-seven deployed — but a stolen voter card can't be reissued before polling day.</s> <s>Police have made no arrests, and the commission says the vote proceeds regardless.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan, the party of Imran Khan says ten inmates tried to strangle its jailed Punjab organiser, Aaliya Hamza, in Kot Lakhpat prison.</s> <s>Party colleagues say they pulled her out during a dispute over toilet water, which is the detail worth holding: a fight over water in a prison is a fight over what the prison isn't providing.</s> <s>Punjab's prisons chief denies any clash happened, and no independent investigation has been opened.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>South Korea's Kospi fell eight percent and halted trading automatically.</s> <s>That halt isn't a decision by anyone — it's a rule, designed to interrupt a panic-selling loop — and it triggered because Samsung and SK Hynix each dropped more than ten percent after Nvidia slid five percent in New York.</s> <s>The Korean market and the memory cycle have become close to the same quantity, and memory prices set the cost of every phone, server and car sold in Karachi, Lagos and Jakarta, where none of the equity upside lands.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Johnson and Johnson will pay five and a half billion dollars to settle sixty-nine thousand talc cancer claims, covering ninety-nine point seven five percent of what remained in New Jersey court.</s> <s>The settlement includes no finding and no admission that talc caused cancer, and that's precisely what the money buys — no precedent, nothing for the next claimant to cite.</s> <s>The company stopped selling talc powder in North America in twenty twenty and continued abroad until twenty twenty-three, so the exposure ran longest where the capacity to sue is least, and there's no fund for anyone in Lagos, Dhaka or Cairo.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil has formally requested World Trade Organization consultations over Washington's tariffs — filing a case it can't finish.</s> <s>The <sub alias="W T O">WTO</sub>'s appellate body has been paralysed since twenty nineteen because the United States blocked appointments to it, so a losing party can appeal into the void and no ruling ever binds.</s> <s>Brasília files anyway because consultations start a sixty-day clock and build the legal predicate for retaliation other members will recognise as lawful... which is what the rules-based order looks like once the state that wrote it stops submitting to it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Guatemala's Zacapa department, gunmen stormed a border village in May, and investigators say the Lorenzana clan is reasserting itself.</s> <s>The patriarch and his children were extradited years ago, and the network survived anyway, because it rests on relationships with local officials and landholders that no arrest removes.</s> <s>Washington is offering five million dollars for the clan's alleged current leader, which is the same instrument that produced the last set of extraditions.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In the Democratic Republic of the Congo, one thousand four hundred and five of three thousand two hundred Ebola patients have died — a fatality rate of forty-four percent.</s> <s>That figure persists despite licensed vaccines and antibody treatments, because ring vaccination depends on tracing every contact of every case, and armed conflict plus distrust of outsiders defeat the tracing before the medicine is ever the problem.</s> <s>The outbreak now spans six provinces, and Nigeria has flagged its own preparations.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Global funding for <sub alias="H I V">HIV</sub> programmes has fallen by one and a half billion dollars, eighteen percent, according to <sub alias="U N AIDS">UNAIDS</sub>.</s> <s>Interrupted antiretroviral therapy lets viral load rebound within weeks and breeds resistance, which forces patients permanently onto costlier second-line drugs — so a funding gap doesn't pause treatment, it makes the next round of treatment more expensive forever.</s> <s>Sub-Saharan Africa relies on donors for eighty-three percent of its prevention funding, and no replacement has been named.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Kenyan lawyer, working with a nurse and local activists, is suing Kenya's government, its pesticide regulator, and several multinational agrochemical firms.</s> <s>Many of the active ingredients registered for sale to Kenyan smallholders are banned or withdrawn in the European Union, and several are manufactured in the countries that banned them — exporting a chemical you won't permit at home is entirely legal, and that legality is the case.</s> <s>What makes this unusual is that it names the regulator alongside the companies, arguing a state's failure to restrict is itself actionable... which, if it succeeds, is a template for every country in the same position.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Aerial surveys of the Lake Chad wetlands have found a waterbird population far larger than anyone could confirm, in a floodplain nobody had been able to walk for fifteen years.</s> <s>Insurgency made ordinary field ecology impossible, so researchers flew transects and modelled from them, and the honest position until now was that nobody knew — this is a terminus of the flyway that European breeding populations depend on.</s> <s>The same marshes are the fishery and the farmland millions of people survive on, and Lake Chad has lost most of its surface area since the nineteen sixties, so any protection drawn without those people repeats a very old error.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Emporia, Kansas, police handcuffed a physics teacher, Lux Claridge, for clapping at a city council meeting about a thousand-acre data centre.</s> <s>The arrest report was then withheld as investigative material, which is the checkable abuse — that exemption exists for open cases, not for a completed arrest at a televised public hearing.</s> <s>Hyperscale data centres are sited through municipal bodies with no capacity to negotiate, and the public hearing is often the only point of contact... so clearing the room isn't incidental to the approval, it's a way of producing one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Canadian man, Brandon Klayme, served eighteen months in prison because of a missing underscore.</s> <s>Police in Wisconsin subpoenaed the wrong Kik username, and every agency downstream — Google, an internet provider, Canada's police — trusted the string without ever comparing it to the original.</s> <s>His conviction was vacated, and no official has been held responsible for the chain that produced it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Moonshot, in Beijing, has published the full weights of a two point eight trillion parameter model.</s> <s>Downloaded weights can be run, inspected and fine-tuned offline, and unlike an API they can't be withdrawn — Anthropic argued this week that this is exactly why releases resist recall, while opposing bans on Chinese open models, and this site's own pipeline runs on Anthropic's systems, so we say that plainly.</s> <s>The leading open-weight models are now mostly Chinese, which is a direct result of American export controls, and it means a university in Karachi or Lagos works on the current generation rather than the last.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>